@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 60 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "壁時計の時刻" as T
concise "計画区間" as P
concise "Range .active" as A
concise "安全出力" as S

@0
T is "07:58"
P is "開始前"
A is "非アクティブ"
S is "OFF"

@2
T is "08:00"
P is "range(10min)"

@6
T is "08:04"
A is "アクティブ"
S is "ON"

@8
T is "08:06"
S is "ブロック"

@10
T is "08:08"
S is "ON"

@12
T is "08:10"
P is "終了"
A is "非アクティブ"
S is "OFF"

@14
T is "08:12"

P@2 <-> @12 : 計画 [08:00, 08:10)
A@6 <-> @12 : 08:04 に遅延受け入れ：残り 6 分
S@8 <-> @10 : 安全ブロック、終了時に追加されない
@enduml
